# vNext Docs Design System

Style: Flat Design + Swiss Modernism hybrid. No gradients, no shadows, typography-focused.

## Typography

- Body/Headings: **IBM Plex Sans** (Google Fonts, weights 300–700)
- Code/Mono: **JetBrains Mono** (Google Fonts, weights 400–700)
- Infima overrides: `--ifm-font-family-base`, `--ifm-font-family-monospace`

## Color Tokens

| Role | Light | Dark |
|------|-------|------|
| Primary | `#2563EB` | `#60A5FA` |
| Background | `#F8FAFC` | `#0F172A` |
| Surface | `#FFFFFF` | `#1E293B` |
| Text | `#1E293B` | `#E2E8F0` |
| Muted | `#475569` | `#94A3B8` |
| Border | `#E2E8F0` | `#334155` |

Use `--vn-*` CSS custom properties (defined in `src/css/custom.css`), not raw hex values.

## Component Rules

- **No emojis as icons** — use inline SVG (Lucide-style, 24x24 viewBox, strokeWidth 1.75)
- **No layout-shifting hovers** — use `border-color`/`opacity`/`color` transitions, never `transform: translateY`
- **Transitions**: 150–200ms ease (`var(--vn-transition)`)
- **Border radius**: `--vn-radius-sm` (6px), `--vn-radius-md` (10px), `--vn-radius-lg` (16px)
- **Admonitions**: Left-border accent style, no heavy background fills
- **Cards**: Left accent border via `--card-accent` CSS variable, flat surface background

## Accessibility

- WCAG AAA contrast target (slate-800 on white = 12.6:1)
- `cursor-pointer` on all clickable elements
- `:focus-visible` outline ring (2px solid primary, 2px offset)
- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` disables all animations
- All images require `alt`; form inputs require `<label>`

## Dark Mode

All dark-mode overrides use `[data-theme='dark']` selector. Never use `@media (prefers-color-scheme)` directly — Docusaurus handles the toggle.

## Responsive Breakpoints

| Width | Target |
|-------|--------|
| 600px | Mobile |
| 768px | Tablet |
| 996px | Docusaurus sidebar collapse |
| 1440px | Wide desktop |

## File Locations

- Design tokens: `src/css/custom.css`
- Homepage: `src/pages/index.tsx` + `src/pages/index.module.css`
- Config: `docusaurus.config.ts` (navbar, footer, announcement bar)
- No `src/theme/` swizzles — all customization via CSS overrides to preserve upgrade-ability
